WEBVTT

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.542
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:25.208
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.292
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:29.042
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.333
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.417
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.375
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.208
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.417
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.292
So what are we up to today?

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:50.500
Where are you taking me, this far away?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
I didn't <i>take </i>you anywhere.
You're the one who came along.

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:56.292
But where is this...

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.500
Watch it, Setsuna! I'll fall off!

00:01:01.542 --> 00:01:03.625
<i>This is my...</i>

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:48.208
"The Hidden Village for Half Demons"

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:58.500
CAT DEMON – KIRARA

00:02:59.833 --> 00:03:03.708
SETSUNA    TOWA HIGURASHI
Hey, Setsuna. Why are we this far into the mountains?

00:03:03.708 --> 00:03:05.167
Going for a walk?

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:09.125
I'm just making my rounds.
That's why I said you didn't have to come.

00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:11.500
So what on earth is here anyway?

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:18.583
There's nothing here.
That's how it's supposed to be.

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.667
What? What does that mean?

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:26.125
The earliest memory I have is
the view of a burnt-up forest.

00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:28.958
You mean the one we were in?

00:03:29.917 --> 00:03:33.708
So it's a memory from
after we got separated?

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:37.917
After that, I lived here for a while.

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:41.792
That was when we were
around four years old, right?

00:03:41.792 --> 00:03:44.417
I'm sorry,
I didn't know anything and I—

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:50.375
I wasn't alone. I had Miss Shiori,
and there were other children, too.

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:54.250
Miss Shiori? Who's that?

00:03:56.167 --> 00:04:00.417
This place is a hidden village
for half-demons that Miss Shiori made.

00:04:00.417 --> 00:04:02.250
A hidden village?

00:04:03.583 --> 00:04:05.000
After that fire...

00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:10.333
<i>I couldn't do anything. </i>
<i> I just sat by the ruins.</i>

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:13.292
<i>But someone came for me.</i>

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:15.125
Hey.

00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:16.625
TWO-HEADED DRAGON – A-UN

00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:18.708
TWO-HEADED DRAGON – A-UN
You there, little girl. Hop on.

00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:22.333
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL – JAKEN
What is it?

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:25.625
You need not fear me. Come now, jump on.

00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:29.375
<i>I was led by a voice </i>
<i>that I couldn't quite place...</i>

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.417
<i>And I was taken to this mountain.</i>

00:04:40.917 --> 00:04:43.125
Survive and live!

00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:51.208
Who are you?

00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:52.750
Yeah, who're you?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.500
No humans allowed.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.083
No demons allowed.

00:04:59.208 --> 00:05:00.708
Say something.

00:05:00.708 --> 00:05:01.708
Yeah, say something.

00:05:04.292 --> 00:05:06.083
You're a half-demon, right?

00:05:06.083 --> 00:05:07.708
You're probably a half-demon.

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:10.333
Half-demon?

00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:11.708
What's the matter?

00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:13.750
HALF-DEMON VILLAGE HEAD – SHIORI
Oh, Miss Shiori.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.083
HALF-DEMON VILLAGE HEAD – SHIORI
Miss Shiori.

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:18.917
My, a child...

00:05:21.792 --> 00:05:24.250
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.000
I was told to give you this...

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:33.792
PLEASE LOOK AFTER HER
Oh, dear...

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:38.792
My child, you seem to be tied
to a strange destiny.

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:42.292
Welcome.

00:05:54.792 --> 00:05:56.917
<i>And Miss Shiori invited me in...</i>

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.833
<i>to a hidden village inhabited </i>
<i>by half-demon children.</i>

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.708
<i>Miss Shiori was a half-demon </i>
<i> from the Demon Bat Tribe</i>

00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:07.625
<i>with the power to create barriers.</i>

00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:11.750
<i>She used her barrier to protect </i>
<i>the peace of the village.</i>

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.333
HALF-DEMON CHILDREN
I'm Futa.

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:14.542
HALF-DEMON CHILDREN
I'm Raita.

00:06:15.042 --> 00:06:17.708
So what happened to your parents?

00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:18.625
Yeah, what happened?

00:06:20.917 --> 00:06:22.250
I don't know.

00:06:22.375 --> 00:06:24.417
That's a little sad.

00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:27.875
My parents were killed by humans.

00:06:27.875 --> 00:06:29.875
My parents were killed by demons.

00:06:31.542 --> 00:06:34.333
But if you don't know,
then that's kind of a big deal.

00:06:36.167 --> 00:06:37.333
Oh.

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:40.542
<i>I got used to living there pretty quickly.</i>

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:44.667
<i>During the day, we went out to gather food, </i>
<i> and at night, we hid.</i>

00:06:45.167 --> 00:06:47.708
<i>I learned numbers </i>
<i>and how to read and write.</i>

00:06:51.125 --> 00:06:52.583
Miss Shiori.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.750
Look what I got!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.583
Miss Shiori, I got a lot, too!

00:06:57.792 --> 00:07:00.708
That's amazing, everyone.
You all worked so hard.

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:02.583
Miss Shiori!

00:07:05.875 --> 00:07:07.708
I brought it down.

00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:09.000
And I caught it.

00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:11.833
Both of you are amazing.

00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:13.583
SETSUNA

00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:17.042
<i>At times, I would receive items </i>
<i> addressed to me.</i>

00:07:18.125 --> 00:07:19.375
What's that?

00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:20.583
Yeah, what is it?

00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:21.625
CUT THE WIND

00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:23.208
"Cut the wind."

00:07:23.792 --> 00:07:27.542
<i>For some reason, I trained</i>
<i> following those orders.</i>

00:07:29.417 --> 00:07:31.042
SETSUNA

00:07:32.083 --> 00:07:32.958
CUT WATER

00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:34.208
"Cut water."

00:07:35.792 --> 00:07:37.375
Cut the water?

00:07:37.375 --> 00:07:39.208
Can it be cut, though?

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:51.875
It's impossible, right?

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:52.833
Impossible.

00:08:06.167 --> 00:08:09.167
<i>Humans would never stray this far </i>
<i> into the mountain,</i>

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.125
<i>but sometimes demons </i>
<i> would make their way here.</i>

00:08:13.083 --> 00:08:17.708
<i>Most of them would give up and leave,</i>
<i> barred by Miss Shiori's barrier.</i>

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:22.042
<i>The really persistent ones </i>
<i> would wait for us to emerge.</i>

00:08:22.792 --> 00:08:26.000
<i>With those demons, </i>
<i>we worked together to take them down.</i>

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.542
Eat this! Wind Scythe!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.792
Eat this! Thunder!

00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:31.792
Scourge of Swallows!

00:08:39.667 --> 00:08:41.625
We did it!

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:44.292
<i>We all worked well together, but...</i>

00:08:48.167 --> 00:08:51.708
<i>Miss Shiori always seemed sad.</i>

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.083
<i>She understood that </i>
<i>we had to kill these enemies,</i>

00:08:55.708 --> 00:09:00.333
<i>but deep down, I think she wished </i>
<i>for the world to be different.</i>

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:17.000
In a forest in the east,
a half-demon child is suffering all alone.

00:09:23.125 --> 00:09:25.083
I'd love it if they decide to come here.

00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:34.000
<i>I had been living here for six years </i>
<i> when a certain letter arrived.</i>

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.500
THE VILLAGE WHERE
YOU WERE BORN...

00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:43.792
Setsuna, it says here that you are to
return to where you were born.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.500
You'll be living there from now on.

00:09:46.917 --> 00:09:49.000
No. I like it here.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.500
Half-demons are able
to live among humans, too.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.500
If you have a place to live a life,

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.542
it's not a bad idea to get to know
human society as well.

00:10:00.417 --> 00:10:03.625
Go and live in the village
where you were born.

00:10:05.917 --> 00:10:09.542
<i>I ended up in the village </i>
<i> where Priestess Kaede lived,</i>

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:11.917
<i>but not for very long.</i>

00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:17.083
<i>There was something I realized after beating up </i>
<i> some bandits who were pillaging the area.</i>

00:10:19.292 --> 00:10:21.083
Y-You bastard!

00:10:23.542 --> 00:10:26.333
She's a monster. Run for it!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.250
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS – KAEDE
Setsuna, that's enough.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:33.750
Setsuna!

00:10:38.875 --> 00:10:40.875
H-Help me!

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:45.917
Setsuna, stop it!

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:48.625
If we don't kill them,
they'll just come again.

00:10:49.792 --> 00:10:54.167
I don't want you to go through such things
when you're still so young.

00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:58.708
I am a half-demon.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:00.833
Setsuna?

00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:04.500
I'm returning to my village.

00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:11.500
Miss Shiori welcomed me back
without asking any questions.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.958
My friends were happy
that I was back, too.

00:11:16.208 --> 00:11:19.000
I returned to my peaceful days
at the village,

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.500
and I thought I would stay there
for the rest of my life.

00:11:23.083 --> 00:11:24.083
But...

00:11:25.125 --> 00:11:27.000
Miss Shiori is also a half-demon.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.542
There are times
when she loses her demon powers.

00:11:30.083 --> 00:11:33.042
In other words, her barrier disappears.

00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:38.500
A demon named Gaga Gozen planned
for that day, and appeared before us.

00:11:39.167 --> 00:11:40.583
Gaga Gozen?

00:11:43.125 --> 00:11:45.000
Miss Shiori is also a half-demon.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.542
There are times
when she loses her demon powers.

00:11:48.083 --> 00:11:51.042
In other words, her barrier disappears.

00:11:52.083 --> 00:11:56.458
A demon named Gaga Gozen planned
for that day, and appeared before us.

00:11:57.125 --> 00:11:58.542
Gaga Gozen?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.417
This happened three years ago.

00:12:05.083 --> 00:12:06.167
Setsuna.

00:12:06.167 --> 00:12:07.250
Yes?

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:13.500
Soon I'll lose my demon powers.
I only hope that nothing happens.

00:12:13.875 --> 00:12:15.542
Miss Shiori!

00:12:16.125 --> 00:12:18.125
Some samurai are here!

00:12:18.125 --> 00:12:19.583
Yeah, they're here.

00:12:20.208 --> 00:12:21.708
Samurai?

00:12:24.792 --> 00:12:27.083
MOTH DEMON – GAGA GOZEN
Lord Gaga, is it this mountain?

00:12:27.083 --> 00:12:28.000
MOTH DEMON – GAGA GOZEN
Yes,

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.583
there are many half-demons here.

00:12:31.042 --> 00:12:36.792
That's what I heard. Many demons have
come here searching for half-demons,

00:12:36.792 --> 00:12:40.458
but they either couldn't find them
or have been taken down.

00:12:41.042 --> 00:12:43.458
Just who do you think I am?

00:12:43.458 --> 00:12:47.458
They couldn't find them because
they're all a horde of brainless idiots.

00:12:47.458 --> 00:12:49.625
I've looked into it, though.

00:12:49.625 --> 00:12:53.333
All the demons that got taken down?
They weren't strong enough.

00:12:55.833 --> 00:12:59.792
I've eaten a hundred samurai,
and I've grown tired of eating them.

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:03.167
It's time to stuff my belly
full of delicious half-demons.

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:10.500
HACHIEMON OF AWA     MIROKU
Miroku, we can't defeat them with just the two of us.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:13.792
We should go back and get help.
He's bad news.

00:13:14.208 --> 00:13:16.917
That demon has already eaten
a hundred samurai.

00:13:16.917 --> 00:13:19.750
We'll look for an opening and
slay him as quickly as possible.

00:13:22.292 --> 00:13:25.083
We can never see eye to eye, huh...

00:13:33.833 --> 00:13:37.333
They look like samurai,
but they're all demons.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:38.708
You can tell?

00:13:38.958 --> 00:13:41.208
My nose works better than yours.

00:13:41.667 --> 00:13:43.500
They all smell like demons.

00:13:43.917 --> 00:13:44.958
What should we do?

00:13:45.333 --> 00:13:50.333
If demons come here,
then it's to eat or kill us half-demons.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.958
But Miss Shiori won't be able to
use her demon powers.

00:13:53.958 --> 00:13:54.833
This is bad.

00:13:55.708 --> 00:14:00.042
If they knew that and came here...
That's pretty annoying.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.375
Behold!

00:14:30.917 --> 00:14:35.667
The one who produces this barrier loses
their demon powers during a solar eclipse.

00:14:37.542 --> 00:14:39.750
Amazing as ever, Lord Gaga.

00:14:40.958 --> 00:14:42.167
Now then...

00:14:42.167 --> 00:14:43.167
Wind Scythe!

00:14:43.167 --> 00:14:44.542
Thunder!

00:15:02.042 --> 00:15:05.958
This naginata is the infamous
Kanemitsu no Tomoe.

00:15:05.958 --> 00:15:09.042
Your dull knife is no match for it.

00:15:12.375 --> 00:15:13.833
What's the matter?

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:18.958
Gaga Gozen, steel yourself!

00:15:23.833 --> 00:15:24.917
That man...

00:15:25.042 --> 00:15:26.458
Eat this! Thunder!

00:15:30.958 --> 00:15:32.458
He's the last one.

00:15:32.458 --> 00:15:33.458
Get him!

00:15:38.375 --> 00:15:41.167
Miroku! See, what did I tell you.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.458
Setsuna, let's get him.

00:15:43.458 --> 00:15:44.417
Yeah, come on, Setsuna.

00:15:44.667 --> 00:15:46.625
Damn half-demons!

00:15:50.458 --> 00:15:52.833
Everyone, over here. Hurry!

00:15:53.458 --> 00:15:54.292
Are you okay?

00:15:56.125 --> 00:15:58.542
I wonder if you can stomach
my poison fog!

00:16:03.583 --> 00:16:05.458
Damn you!

00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:11.208
Setsuna!

00:16:14.792 --> 00:16:18.917
Now, you stay down.
I'll save you for later.

00:16:19.542 --> 00:16:23.583
Look at you half-demons,
you all look absolutely scrumptious!

00:16:23.958 --> 00:16:25.625
– Wind Scythe!
– Thunder!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.792
Hmph, such nonsense.

00:16:28.417 --> 00:16:31.875
Now, which one shall I eat first?

00:16:32.208 --> 00:16:33.667
Please stop it!

00:16:35.208 --> 00:16:38.042
Why don't I start with you, then?

00:16:47.083 --> 00:16:53.417
Little girl. Do you think you, a mere half-demon,
can defeat me, Gaga Gozen?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.167
You damn worm!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.875
You did it!

00:17:03.875 --> 00:17:04.875
Setsuna!

00:17:14.292 --> 00:17:15.708
Wait, Setsuna.

00:17:16.583 --> 00:17:20.333
Your demon blood isn't settling down.
If you cannot quell it...

00:17:20.708 --> 00:17:21.750
Go away!

00:17:24.042 --> 00:17:26.833
Die, die, die!

00:17:27.708 --> 00:17:29.333
Die!

00:17:29.708 --> 00:17:30.708
Oh, no.

00:17:33.292 --> 00:17:36.292
Setsuna, stop! Please!

00:17:37.458 --> 00:17:40.583
Calm down, Setsuna. Please.

00:17:41.083 --> 00:17:44.000
That's it... Take deep breaths.

00:17:47.667 --> 00:17:48.667
Miss Shiori!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.625
Pardon!

00:17:55.375 --> 00:17:57.708
Setsuna? Setsuna?!

00:17:59.125 --> 00:18:01.333
Are you okay, Setsuna?

00:18:01.625 --> 00:18:04.708
Um, what you just used
didn't kill her, right?

00:18:04.708 --> 00:18:07.875
It did not. This is a sedative
used by demon slayers.

00:18:08.583 --> 00:18:12.875
It's especially effective for Setsuna,
with her keen sense of smell.

00:18:13.833 --> 00:18:15.333
Thank goodness.

00:18:27.042 --> 00:18:30.167
I'll apply a seal
that will suppress her demon blood.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.125
This naginata will act as the medium.

00:18:37.625 --> 00:18:39.417
Let's begin.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:46.458
On meeting an arhat, slay the arhat;
on meeting your parents, slay your parents...

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:49.417
Know that the light to your path lies there.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.875
This should be good for now.

00:19:01.208 --> 00:19:05.667
Setsuna has inherited demon blood
that is too powerful for her half-demon body.

00:19:07.042 --> 00:19:10.167
Um, you're Monk Miroku, aren't you?

00:19:10.542 --> 00:19:14.292
I am. And I'm glad
you're in good health, Lady Shiori.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.125
You grew up so beautifully, too.

00:19:17.417 --> 00:19:19.083
Is your mother here as well?

00:19:19.375 --> 00:19:23.583
No, she passed away...
An illness overtook her.

00:19:25.167 --> 00:19:28.125
Such is the fate of humans, I'm afraid.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:34.708
<i>Some time after Monk Miroku left, </i>
<i> Miss Shiori told me to leave the village.</i>

00:19:35.375 --> 00:19:40.083
Setsuna. You are no longer so weak
that you have to live in hiding.

00:19:40.583 --> 00:19:43.500
Live in the outside world,
for your own sake.

00:19:45.292 --> 00:19:47.042
Setsuna, take care!

00:19:47.042 --> 00:19:48.583
Yeah, take care!

00:19:48.958 --> 00:19:53.583
Oh, you two will eventually
have to leave this village, too.

00:19:54.167 --> 00:19:57.417
Setsuna is just leaving
a little earlier than everyone.

00:19:57.417 --> 00:19:59.167
I don't wanna!

00:20:00.208 --> 00:20:04.167
Setsuna, if you ever meet
a half-demon child who's in trouble,

00:20:04.167 --> 00:20:06.250
can you tell them about this village?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.583
I will.

00:20:08.583 --> 00:20:11.583
Okay. Off you go, then.

00:20:11.583 --> 00:20:12.500
All right.

00:20:22.875 --> 00:20:27.500
Back at Priestess Kaede's village,
I was invited to join the demon slayers.

00:20:28.208 --> 00:20:32.292
I never knew that
Monk Miroku was Hisui's father.

00:20:33.083 --> 00:20:36.292
So that naginata
was a spoil from a battle, huh?

00:20:36.542 --> 00:20:38.625
It's a human-made piece.

00:20:38.625 --> 00:20:40.292
I've been using it with appreciation.

00:20:40.625 --> 00:20:43.417
It's also my seal for my demon powers.

00:20:45.708 --> 00:20:48.875
You sure did a lot of talking today.
Why's that?

00:20:49.625 --> 00:20:54.083
Because Miss Shiori told me that if there
was a troubled half-demon child,

00:20:54.083 --> 00:20:55.917
I'm to tell them about this village.

00:20:55.917 --> 00:21:01.167
What do you mean?
I'm not troubled, and I'm not even a child.

00:21:01.625 --> 00:21:02.833
Geez.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:13.417
Here it is. This is the mountain
where half-demons are said to be hiding.

00:21:13.417 --> 00:21:17.792
They think they're so clever.
Let's just find them and eat them.

00:21:23.458 --> 00:21:26.125
My horns!

00:21:28.458 --> 00:21:30.292
You think you're so clever.

00:21:30.833 --> 00:21:32.542
If you ever come here again,

00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:34.625
death will be a sweet thing.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:40.083
Bastards like them still manage
to make their way here.

00:21:40.708 --> 00:21:44.125
Although I hope things
can quiet down a little.

00:21:44.125 --> 00:21:47.042
Setsuna. You've been doing
this for a while, huh?

00:21:48.042 --> 00:21:51.042
Sometimes.
When I have time on my hands.

00:21:51.417 --> 00:21:55.042
Because to you, this place
is one of your precious homes, right?

00:21:56.167 --> 00:21:57.208
Kirara.

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:08.792
Thank you, Setsuna.

00:23:43.042 --> 00:23:44.917
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:45.292 --> 00:23:49.917
Winter fireflies dance in the night.
Riku tells me about the lady who looked after him,

00:23:49.917 --> 00:23:52.750
and about his master
who loves gazing up at the stars.

00:23:53.042 --> 00:23:55.625
Totetsu turns up out of the blue!

00:23:55.625 --> 00:23:58.792
You got in the way of our date!
It's in poor taste!

00:23:58.792 --> 00:24:00.958
Why are you helping me, Riku?

00:24:01.625 --> 00:24:05.292
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Secret of the Rainbow Pearls"

00:24:05.292 --> 00:24:06.958
These Pearls were born

00:24:06.958 --> 00:24:23.979
on the day your grandfather,
the Great Dog-Demon, passed away.
